<div class="glass card act" id="action-host-pentest" style="grid-column: 1 / -1">
      <div class="act-title">🖥 Host pentest — credentialed, sandboxed SSH enumeration</div>
      <div class="d" style="margin-bottom:8px">Needs a third gate — <code>ZYVOR_CREDENTIALED_PENTEST_ENABLED=true</code> — and <code>ZYVOR_SANDBOX_HOST_IMAGE</code> (paramiko) configured server-side. <b>Creds must reference server-side env vars — the values below are never sent</b>, only the env var <i>names</i> the server already has set.</div>
